Hi Eric,

We posted a fix to this bug in the development version of Amelia. You
can get the development version of Amelia by opening R and running the
following command:

install.packages("Amelia", repos = "http://r.iq.harvard.edu", type = "source")

Now you can fire up AmeliaView just like before and the "intercs" bug
should be fixed.

